the n0 is samplehold
the n1 is froglet tune=-0.34 att.trig=-1.67
the n2 is matrix
the n3 is dcblock samplerate=half
the n4 is follower samplerate=half
n4 -150> n1
fader4 -> n1.pitch
n4.gate -75> n2
n3 -> n2.in2
n0 >| n2.in3
n4.gate -> n2.in4
n3 ~> n4
n0.track -35> n4.attack
n3 -> right
n4 -> right
n2 -> left
n0 -> left
